[00:00.00] 作词 : Felix Joseph/Olivia Dean
[00:00.00][by:Prankstergangster]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Felix Joseph/Olivia Dean
[00:09.21]I'm not as strong as I appear
[00:09.21]我不同于我显露的那般坚强
[00:14.65]I'm way more anxious than I seem
[00:14.65]我比表面所展现的更加焦虑
[00:19.96]What kind of person would I be
[00:19.96]我会成为怎样的人
[00:25.48]If I didn't hide this part of me
[00:25.48]假如我不曾隐藏这部分的我
[00:30.79]I'm sorry if you see me go
[00:30.79]如果你看到我离开，我很抱歉
[00:36.10]But I feel strange and I don't know
[00:36.10]但是不知怎么的，我觉得很奇怪
[00:41.42]What kind of person that makes me
[00:41.42]谁让我变成如此
[00:46.73]I guess the same as you, maybe
[00:46.73]想是和你一样的人，大概吧
[00:52.30]Under the table, squeeze my hand
[00:52.30]在桌下，紧握着我的手
[00:57.89]I need to know you understand
[00:57.89]我需要知道，你能够理解
[01:02.93]So, I been thinking lately
[01:02.93]最近我一直在想
[01:05.52]Everybody's crazy
[01:05.52]兴许大家都疯了吧
[01:15.43]You told me you felt insecure
[01:15.43]你向我倾诉你感到的不安
[01:20.75]And that makes you no less of a man
[01:20.75]它让你感觉自己不像个男人
[01:26.32]It only made me love you more
[01:26.32]但这只会使我更加的爱你
[01:31.63]'Cause I find it hard to say I am
[01:31.63]因为我很难坦露自己的内心
[01:36.61]You forgot yourself and that's okay
[01:36.61]就算你忘记了自我，那也没关系
[01:41.92]Open the door and let me see
[01:41.92]敞开你的心扉，让我看到真实的你
[01:47.50]Oh, I love it when you say
[01:47.50]噢，我喜欢你对着我说
[01:52.55]You feel as crazy as me
[01:52.55]你也跟我一样感到荒唐
[01:58.13]Under the table, squeeze my hand
[01:58.13]在桌下，紧握着我的手
[02:03.70]I need to know you understand
[02:03.70]我需要知道你也能理解
[02:09.02]So, I been thinking lately
[02:09.02]我最近一直在想
[02:11.87]Everybody's crazy
[02:11.87]兴许大家都疯了吧
